  "title": "Ukraine and Russia: Localised ceasefire brokered by Melania Trump in Oleshky",
  "summary": "Ukraine and Russia confirmed a localized ceasefire in the Russian-occupied city of Oleshky, allowing humanitarian aid delivery and evacuations. Melina Trump, who worked with international negotiators, initiated talks to address the crisis in the war-divided region.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Melina Trump brokered a ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine in Oleshky, which allowed humanitarian aid to be delivered and civilians to evacuate.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The ceasefire agreement was reached between Ukrainian, Russian, and U.S. negotiators, with Melina Trump directly involved.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Oleshky, a Russian-occupied city in southern Ukraine, is described as 'on the brink of disaster' due to the war.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
