      "description": "First lady Melania Trump has brokered a ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine in the ravaged, Russian-occupied Ukrainian city of Oleshky so that humanitarian aid can be delivered and civilians can be evacuated from a place she said is \"on the brink of disaster\".\nThe localised ceasefire is set to begin next week.\nUkrainian, Russian and US negotiators reached a deal on Friday to provide humanitarian relief to the Russian-occupied town of Oleshky in the war-divided region of Kherson in southern Ukraine.\nMelania Trump, who worked with officials from both countries on a separate matter, initiated talks about Oleshky after learning about the situation at one of her events during the UN General Assembly session in September, the White House said in announcing her involvement.\nShe and a representative worked directly with Russian and Ukrainian leadership to define the terms of the ceasefire, the White House said.\nUkraine's top negotiator in the effort told The Associated Press that a local",
